{"ID":"20240515131450-52xzpo3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131450-52xzpo3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131450-52xzpo3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132736-6d74kwt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132736-6d74kwt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515132736-6d74kwt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:602,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:604\u0026#125;","title":"011","type":"doc","updated":"20240515150237"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515132736-6d74kwt","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 892px;","id":"20240515132736-6d74kwt","updated":"20240515150237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/06"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"BS"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18歲, 嬌小身材"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/19"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"焦慮, 有低血糖証, 輕微頭痛, 倦怠, 心悸(不規則跳動), 手抖。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠：好, 不易入眠。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月事：正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：每日一行, 時不易出。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：淡黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足溫度：雙足冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手額溫度：手指冰, 額頭熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身溫：身體時冷時熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴： 冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口： 一直是餓的。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出汗：半夜盜汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈小細緩, 右大于左"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌苔淡黃, 舌紅"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心血不足，上熱下寒。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏三兩 知母五錢 炮附子四錢 細辛二錢  桂枝四錢 炙甘草五錢 白芍四錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨三錢 牡蠣六錢 大棗十枚 黨參三錢 熟地二錢 阿膠三錢 (分三次烊化) "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻子仁三錢 麥冬三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗 →3碗 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各服 1碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏、知母→降胃熱 (胃口太好)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝、炙甘草→心臟動力不足(手指冰)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附子、 細辛、白芍、炙甘草→下焦寒(雙足冷)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"龍骨、牡蠣→ 潛陽(手指冰, 額頭熱)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 桂枝 、炙甘草、大棗、黨參、熟地、阿膠、 麻子仁 、麥冬 →  炙甘草湯→補心血 (心悸, 不易入眠)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 右脈大于左脈→氣勝血是男人正常脈, 女人正常脈應該左大于右"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因他會很餓故勿用生薑再刺激他的胃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此女的心熱無法到小腸只能到胃，故胃熱胃蠕動快因此他易餓。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此女的心熱無法下到小腸故反逆於上而造成肺熱，肺有熱而魄不能靜故焦慮"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"心熱若能下到小腸，則小腸熱了以後腎也會熱，則焦慮會除。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}